@page "/group-rides"
@attribute [Authorize]

<PageTitle>Group rides — Dumb Luck Rides</PageTitle>

@*
	The signed-in entry point to group rides (§5.2).

	Phase 2 does not yet ship a "rides I have joined" endpoint — the server tracks
	membership per ride, and joining is by explicit code or via a request. So the
	landing offers the two entry points and a link to the ride you were last on
	once it exists.
*@

<div class="page page-medium">
	<h1>Group rides</h1>

	<p class="lead">
		Two ways into a ride, and the organiser controls both — they gave you the join
		code, or they admitted your request (§5.2).
	</p>

	<div class="cards">
		<a class="card" href="/group-rides/join">
			<h2>Join a ride</h2>
			<p>Enter a code the organiser gave you.</p>
		</a>
		<a class="card" href="/group-rides/create">
			<h2>Create a ride</h2>
			<p>Start a ride of your own. You will be the organiser.</p>
		</a>
	</div>
</div>
